### REST Client Test File for Authentication Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiAuth = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth
@apiUsers = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users

### ============================================
### 1. Create User (needed for testing)
### ============================================

### 1. Create User - Success
# @name createTestUser
POST {{apiAuth}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "User",
    "email": "test@mail.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "dni": "11112222",
    "phone": "1234567890"
}

### ============================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 2. Login - Success
# @name login
POST {{apiAuth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@mail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 3. Validate Token - Success
# @name validateToken
GET {{apiAuth}}/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 4. Refresh Token - Success
# @name refreshToken
POST {{apiAuth}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "{{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}"
}

### 5. Logout - Success
# @name logout
POST {{apiAuth}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}